<% is_fr = I18n.locale.to_s.start_with?('fr') %>
<aside class="feedback-sticky-banner" role="complementary" aria-label="<%= is_fr ? 'Sondage de r?troaction Canadiana 2.0' : 'Canadiana 2.0 feedback survey' %>" data-controller="feedback-banner">
  <div class="feedback-sticky-banner__inner">
    <div class="feedback-sticky-banner__text">
      <% if is_fr %>
        Merci d'avoir visit? la plateforme Canadiana en version b?ta! Nous serions ravis de conna?tre votre avis. Veuillez nous <a href="https://form.simplesurvey.com/f/r/laFfRoM4?lang=FR" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="feedback-sticky-banner__link">faire part de vos commentaires</a> sur la nouvelle interface. <a href="https://bit.ly/4yTyl8g" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="feedback-sticky-banner__link">En savoir plus</a> sur ces changements.
      <% else %>
        Thank you for visiting the Canadiana beta platform! We would love to know what you think. Please <a href="https://form.simplesurvey.com/f/r/laFfRoM4" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="feedback-sticky-banner__link">share your feedback</a> on the new interface and <a href="https://bit.ly/3WbBdPb" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="feedback-sticky-banner__link">learn more about these changes</a>.
      <% end %>
    </div>
    <button type="button"
            class="feedback-sticky-banner__close btn-close btn-close-white"
            aria-label="<%= is_fr ? 'Fermer le bandeau' : 'Close banner' %>"
            data-action="feedback-banner#close">
    </button>
  </div>
</aside>
